{"$schema": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/guitaripod/wwdc-sessions/master/schema/transcript.schema.json", "id": "wwdc2019-720", "language": "eng", "source": "https://developer.apple.com/videos/play/wwdc2019/720", "wordCount": 2573, "segments": [{"start": 7.0, "text": "Hi. I'm Brian Weinstein, an"}, {"start": 10.0, "text": "Engineer on the Safari Team."}, {"start": 12.0, "text": "And today, I'm going to talk"}, {"start": 14.0, "text": "about what's new in Safari"}, {"start": 16.0, "text": "Extensions."}, {"start": 17.0, "text": "Safari Extensions let you extend"}, {"start": 19.0, "text": "Safari's behavior."}, {"start": 21.0, "text": "You can enhance a user's"}, {"start": 22.0, "text": "browsing experience by adding"}, {"start": 24.0, "text": "scripts or style sheets to web"}, {"start": 26.0, "text": "pages, blocking content, and"}, {"start": 28.0, "text": "adding to Safari's UI."}, {"start": 31.0, "text": "We are going to cover how Safari"}, {"start": 34.0, "text": "Extensions are built and"}, {"start": 35.0, "text": "distributed, how your Safari App"}, {"start": 38.0, "text": "Extension can be notified about"}, {"start": 40.0, "text": "the activity of your Content"}, {"start": 42.0, "text": "Blocker, better support for"}, {"start": 44.0, "text": "window, tab, and page management"}, {"start": 47.0, "text": "in your extension, improvements"}, {"start": 49.0, "text": "made to Safari App Extension"}, {"start": 51.0, "text": "popovers, and some of the best"}, {"start": 54.0, "text": "practices for communicating"}, {"start": 56.0, "text": "between your Safari Extension"}, {"start": 58.0, "text": "and its containing app."}, {"start": 61.0, "text": "There are two types of Safari"}, {"start": 63.0, "text": "Extensions that I'm going to"}, {"start": 64.0, "text": "focus on today, Content Blockers"}, {"start": 68.0, "text": "and Safari App Extensions."}, {"start": 70.0, "text": "Both of these extensions are"}, {"start": 72.0, "text": "bundled with Mac apps which are"}, {"start": 73.0, "text": "built with Xcode."}, {"start": 76.0, "text": "When you install an app with a"}, {"start": 78.0, "text": "Safari App Extension from the"}, {"start": 80.0, "text": "Mac App Store, the extension"}, {"start": 82.0, "text": "shows up immediately in Safari's"}, {"start": 84.0, "text": "preferences, ready to turn on."}, {"start": 88.0, "text": "However, you can also distribute"}, {"start": 91.0, "text": "your app directly from your"}, {"start": 92.0, "text": "website after running it through"}, {"start": 94.0, "text": "the notarization service."}, {"start": 96.0, "text": "Notarized apps need to be"}, {"start": 97.0, "text": "launched at least once for their"}, {"start": 99.0, "text": "extensions to show up in Safari."}, {"start": 102.0, "text": "We love the Safari App"}, {"start": 104.0, "text": "Extensions and Content Blockers"}, {"start": 105.0, "text": "you've created."}, {"start": 107.0, "text": "We also really appreciate those"}, {"start": 108.0, "text": "of you who suggested"}, {"start": 110.0, "text": "improvements, filed bug reports,"}, {"start": 112.0, "text": "and commented on the Safari"}, {"start": 114.0, "text": "developer forums."}, {"start": 118.0, "text": "One of the features we've heard"}, {"start": 120.0, "text": "the most requests for is a way"}, {"start": 122.0, "text": "for extensions to know when"}, {"start": 124.0, "text": "their Content Blocker performs"}, {"start": 126.0, "text": "an action."}, {"start": 128.0, "text": "Content Blockers provide a"}, {"start": 130.0, "text": "declarative list of rules"}, {"start": 132.0, "text": "defining the content to block or"}, {"start": 134.0, "text": "hide while using Safari."}, {"start": 137.0, "text": "Safari requests the list of"}, {"start": 139.0, "text": "rules from your Content Blocker"}, {"start": 141.0, "text": "when it's turned on."}, {"start": 143.0, "text": "The user does some browsing, and"}, {"start": 145.0, "text": "when your Content Blocker flags"}, {"start": 147.0, "text": "a resource as something that"}, {"start": 148.0, "text": "should be blocked, now in Safari"}, {"start": 152.0, "text": "13, Safari tells your Safari App"}, {"start": 155.0, "text": "Extension associated with your"}, {"start": 157.0, "text": "Content Blocker about it."}, {"start": 160.0, "text": "Your users will be able to turn"}, {"start": 161.0, "text": "on the associated Safari App"}, {"start": 163.0, "text": "Extension if they want to see"}, {"start": 165.0, "text": "statistics from you or they can"}, {"start": 168.0, "text": "turn on only the Content Blocker"}, {"start": 170.0, "text": "to keep the most private"}, {"start": 171.0, "text": "experience."}, {"start": 172.0, "text": "Let's take a look at how easy"}, {"start": 174.0, "text": "this is to do."}, {"start": 176.0, "text": "The first step is associating"}, {"start": 179.0, "text": "your Content Blocker with your"}, {"start": 180.0, "text": "Safari App Extension in your"}, {"start": 182.0, "text": "extensions info.plist file."}, {"start": 185.0, "text": "To do this, add a new entry to"}, {"start": 188.0, "text": "the NSExtension section of your"}, {"start": 190.0, "text": "Safari App Extension's"}, {"start": 192.0, "text": "info.plist."}, {"start": 194.0, "text": "The key is SFSafariAssociatedContentBlockers."}, {"start": 201.0, "text": "And the value is an array of"}, {"start": 203.0, "text": "Content Blocker bundle"}, {"start": 205.0, "text": "identifiers that the Safari App"}, {"start": 207.0, "text": "Extension wants to be notified"}, {"start": 209.0, "text": "about."}, {"start": 210.0, "text": "One Safari App Extension can be"}, {"start": 212.0, "text": "notified about multiple Content"}, {"start": 214.0, "text": "Blockers."}, {"start": 215.0, "text": "One thing to keep in mind is"}, {"start": 217.0, "text": "that the Content Blockers and"}, {"start": 218.0, "text": "the Safari App Extension must be"}, {"start": 221.0, "text": "in the same containing app."}, {"start": 226.0, "text": "Then, once you've set up your"}, {"start": 228.0, "text": "info.plist, you will need to"}, {"start": 230.0, "text": "implement a delegate method on"}, {"start": 232.0, "text": "your extension's principal"}, {"start": 233.0, "text": "object."}, {"start": 234.0, "text": "That method is content blocker"}, {"start": 236.0, "text": "with identifier, blocked"}, {"start": 238.0, "text": "resources with URLs on page."}, {"start": 242.0, "text": "These notifications are batched"}, {"start": 244.0, "text": "and you will only be notified"}, {"start": 246.0, "text": "about URLs that your Safari App"}, {"start": 249.0, "text": "Extension has permission to"}, {"start": 250.0, "text": "access in the website access"}, {"start": 252.0, "text": "section of its info.plist."}, {"start": 256.0, "text": "That's all it takes."}, {"start": 259.0, "text": "Now, let's move on to the"}, {"start": 260.0, "text": "improvements made to window,"}, {"start": 262.0, "text": "tab, and page management."}, {"start": 265.0, "text": "The first enhancement is another"}, {"start": 267.0, "text": "frequent request, an API to tell"}, {"start": 270.0, "text": "you when a page is about to"}, {"start": 272.0, "text": "perform a navigation."}, {"start": 274.0, "text": "You can pair this with the"}, {"start": 275.0, "text": "Content Blocker notifications"}, {"start": 277.0, "text": "you just heard about to know any"}, {"start": 279.0, "text": "future notifications will be for"}, {"start": 281.0, "text": "a new page load."}, {"start": 284.0, "text": "The first enhancement is another"}, {"start": 286.0, "text": "frequent request, an API to tell"}, {"start": 288.0, "text": "you when a page is about to"}, {"start": 290.0, "text": "perform a navigation."}, {"start": 292.0, "text": "You can pair this with the"}, {"start": 294.0, "text": "Content Blocker notifications"}, {"start": 296.0, "text": "you just heard about to know any"}, {"start": 298.0, "text": "future notifications will be for"}, {"start": 300.0, "text": "a new page load."}, {"start": 301.0, "text": "Or you can use this to follow"}, {"start": 304.0, "text": "the redirect chain across the"}, {"start": 306.0, "text": "loading of a specific page in"}, {"start": 308.0, "text": "order to redirect to a specific"}, {"start": 310.0, "text": "version of a website or to look"}, {"start": 313.0, "text": "at the URL parameters to"}, {"start": 314.0, "text": "determine if your extension has"}, {"start": 316.0, "text": "already shown its UI to the"}, {"start": 318.0, "text": "user."}, {"start": 319.0, "text": "This method will be called on"}, {"start": 321.0, "text": "your extension's principal"}, {"start": 322.0, "text": "object even if your extension"}, {"start": 325.0, "text": "doesn't have access to the"}, {"start": 326.0, "text": "target URL."}, {"start": 327.0, "text": "In that case, the URL will be"}, {"start": 330.0, "text": "nil. The URL will also be nil if the"}, {"start": 333.0, "text": "user opened their favorites or"}, {"start": 335.0, "text": "their history."}, {"start": 338.0, "text": "Let's adopt these new APIs in a"}, {"start": 340.0, "text": "sample extension."}, {"start": 343.0, "text": "At a previous WWDC, when Safari"}, {"start": 347.0, "text": "App Extensions were introduced,"}, {"start": 349.0, "text": "we created an extension that"}, {"start": 351.0, "text": "replaces the word \"bear\" with"}, {"start": 353.0, "text": "the bear emoji."}, {"start": 354.0, "text": "Today, I'd like to expand this"}, {"start": 357.0, "text": "extension to make life easier"}, {"start": 359.0, "text": "for bears on the internet."}, {"start": 361.0, "text": "So far, I've made a Content"}, {"start": 363.0, "text": "Blocker that blocks all images"}, {"start": 366.0, "text": "with honey in the URL to remove"}, {"start": 370.0, "text": "the temptation for sweets."}, {"start": 372.0, "text": "Let's associate that Content"}, {"start": 373.0, "text": "Blocker with our existing Safari"}, {"start": 376.0, "text": "App Extension."}, {"start": 377.0, "text": "I'll start by opening the Safari"}, {"start": 379.0, "text": "App Extension's info.plist."}, {"start": 382.0, "text": "To associate a Content Blocker,"}, {"start": 384.0, "text": "I'll add an SF Safari associated"}, {"start": 387.0, "text": "Content Blockers entry to the"}, {"start": 390.0, "text": "NSExtension section."}, {"start": 392.0, "text": "I'm going to open the XML viewer"}, {"start": 395.0, "text": "to paste the source code in."}, {"start": 404.0, "text": "And then go back to the plist"}, {"start": 406.0, "text": "viewer."}, {"start": 413.0, "text": "It's an array with one entry,"}, {"start": 415.0, "text": "the bundle identifier of my new"}, {"start": 417.0, "text": "Content Blocker."}, {"start": 419.0, "text": "The next step is to listen for"}, {"start": 421.0, "text": "the content blocking"}, {"start": 422.0, "text": "notifications."}, {"start": 428.0, "text": "What we'll do is build up a map"}, {"start": 431.0, "text": "between SF Safari pages and the"}, {"start": 434.0, "text": "list of resources that have been"}, {"start": 435.0, "text": "blocked on that page."}, {"start": 438.0, "text": "When we get a notification that"}, {"start": 440.0, "text": "the Content Blocker blocked"}, {"start": 441.0, "text": "resources, we find the list of"}, {"start": 444.0, "text": "blocked resources for that page"}, {"start": 447.0, "text": "and add the resources we were"}, {"start": 449.0, "text": "just told about."}, {"start": 451.0, "text": "When a page navigates, we want"}, {"start": 453.0, "text": "to clear that list."}, {"start": 456.0, "text": "To do this, we will override"}, {"start": 460.0, "text": "page will navigate to URL and"}, {"start": 463.0, "text": "use that to clear the blocked"}, {"start": 464.0, "text": "resources for the page."}, {"start": 467.0, "text": "The last thing we want to do is"}, {"start": 469.0, "text": "set the badge of our toolbar"}, {"start": 470.0, "text": "item to be the number of blocked"}, {"start": 472.0, "text": "resources on that page."}, {"start": 477.0, "text": "When we're asked to validate a"}, {"start": 479.0, "text": "toolbar item for a window, we"}, {"start": 482.0, "text": "find the active tab in that"}, {"start": 483.0, "text": "window, find its active page,"}, {"start": 487.0, "text": "and get the number of blocked"}, {"start": 489.0, "text": "resources on that page from our"}, {"start": 491.0, "text": "map."}, {"start": 492.0, "text": "Let's see it in action."}, {"start": 495.0, "text": "We'll build and run Animalify so"}, {"start": 497.0, "text": "the system can discover our"}, {"start": 499.0, "text": "extensions."}, {"start": 506.0, "text": "Once we've run the app, you can"}, {"start": 509.0, "text": "see the splash screen with a"}, {"start": 511.0, "text": "button to take your users to"}, {"start": 512.0, "text": "Safari's extensions preferences."}, {"start": 515.0, "text": "You can get the splash screen"}, {"start": 516.0, "text": "for free in your app if you"}, {"start": 518.0, "text": "create a Safari Extension App"}, {"start": 521.0, "text": "from Xcode."}, {"start": 523.0, "text": "Let's launch Safari, which takes"}, {"start": 524.0, "text": "me to my homepage,"}, {"start": 526.0, "text": "bearseating.com, so I can have"}, {"start": 528.0, "text": "some food inspiration for the"}, {"start": 530.0, "text": "day."}, {"start": 531.0, "text": "Since I'm just experimenting"}, {"start": 533.0, "text": "with writing Safari Extensions,"}, {"start": 535.0, "text": "I don't have an Apple developer"}, {"start": 536.0, "text": "certificate yet."}, {"start": 537.0, "text": "That's OK because I can"}, {"start": 539.0, "text": "temporarily tell Safari to run"}, {"start": 542.0, "text": "these extensions by first"}, {"start": 544.0, "text": "opening Safari's preferences,"}, {"start": 547.0, "text": "going to advanced, and turning"}, {"start": 550.0, "text": "on the develop menu."}, {"start": 553.0, "text": "Once I've done that, I can open"}, {"start": 555.0, "text": "the develop menu and check allow"}, {"start": 557.0, "text": "unsigned extensions."}, {"start": 559.0, "text": "Let's go in to Safari's"}, {"start": 562.0, "text": "extensions preferences, turn on"}, {"start": 564.0, "text": "our Content Blocker and our"}, {"start": 566.0, "text": "Safari App Extension, and reload"}, {"start": 568.0, "text": "bearseating.com."}, {"start": 570.0, "text": "As you can see, the Content"}, {"start": 572.0, "text": "Blocker blocked the pictures of"}, {"start": 574.0, "text": "the bears eating honey, and our"}, {"start": 576.0, "text": "toolbar time is badged with the"}, {"start": 578.0, "text": "number 3, because there were 3"}, {"start": 580.0, "text": "resources blocked."}, {"start": 582.0, "text": "If I reload the page without"}, {"start": 584.0, "text": "Content Blockers, the toolbar"}, {"start": 586.0, "text": "item's badge clears and you can"}, {"start": 588.0, "text": "see the images that were blocked"}, {"start": 590.0, "text": "again."}, {"start": 591.0, "text": "And when you reload one more"}, {"start": 592.0, "text": "time, those images are gone."}, {"start": 595.0, "text": "And that's how easy it is to"}, {"start": 597.0, "text": "adopt content blocking and page"}, {"start": 599.0, "text": "navigation notifications."}, {"start": 605.0, "text": "Those are just a couple of the"}, {"start": 606.0, "text": "many new APIs available to"}, {"start": 609.0, "text": "Safari App Extensions."}, {"start": 611.0, "text": "Let's look at some others."}, {"start": 613.0, "text": "We've added the ability to get"}, {"start": 615.0, "text": "the visible contents of an SF"}, {"start": 617.0, "text": "Safari page."}, {"start": 619.0, "text": "Your extension will need to have"}, {"start": 620.0, "text": "access to the URL of the page in"}, {"start": 623.0, "text": "order to get image data from"}, {"start": 625.0, "text": "this API."}, {"start": 627.0, "text": "With the latest version of"}, {"start": 628.0, "text": "Safari, it is now much easier to"}, {"start": 631.0, "text": "show users content from your"}, {"start": 632.0, "text": "Safari Extensions bundle."}, {"start": 635.0, "text": "You can now get the base URL of"}, {"start": 638.0, "text": "your extension from native code."}, {"start": 640.0, "text": "There's no need to inject script"}, {"start": 642.0, "text": "to do this anymore."}, {"start": 646.0, "text": "You can navigate a tab to a URL"}, {"start": 649.0, "text": "directly also without needing an"}, {"start": 651.0, "text": "injected script."}, {"start": 655.0, "text": "And finally, Safari now injects"}, {"start": 658.0, "text": "the Safari JavaScript object"}, {"start": 660.0, "text": "into any frames loaded with"}, {"start": 662.0, "text": "content from your extension,"}, {"start": 664.0, "text": "meaning those frames can send"}, {"start": 666.0, "text": "messages to the Safari App"}, {"start": 667.0, "text": "Extension and receive messages"}, {"start": 670.0, "text": "from it."}, {"start": 672.0, "text": "Safari extensions can now find"}, {"start": 674.0, "text": "out about all the open tabs and"}, {"start": 677.0, "text": "windows in Safari, not just the"}, {"start": 679.0, "text": "active window and tab."}, {"start": 682.0, "text": "Here, you can see code that gets"}, {"start": 684.0, "text": "all the windows in the"}, {"start": 685.0, "text": "application, and then for each"}, {"start": 687.0, "text": "window gets all of its tabs."}, {"start": 696.0, "text": "You can also get a reference to"}, {"start": 698.0, "text": "a pages containing tab and the"}, {"start": 700.0, "text": "tabs containing window."}, {"start": 703.0, "text": "For example, consider handling a"}, {"start": 705.0, "text": "message from your content script"}, {"start": 707.0, "text": "that requires you to update the"}, {"start": 709.0, "text": "toolbar item in that window."}, {"start": 711.0, "text": "You can get the pages containing"}, {"start": 712.0, "text": "tab and then the tabs containing"}, {"start": 715.0, "text": "window."}, {"start": 720.0, "text": "One thing to keep in mind is"}, {"start": 721.0, "text": "that a pinned tab will have a"}, {"start": 723.0, "text": "nil containing window because"}, {"start": 725.0, "text": "they belong to all windows"}, {"start": 726.0, "text": "instead of a single parent"}, {"start": 728.0, "text": "window."}, {"start": 729.0, "text": "Those were the improvements made"}, {"start": 731.0, "text": "to window, tab, and page"}, {"start": 733.0, "text": "management."}, {"start": 735.0, "text": "The last set of API improvements"}, {"start": 738.0, "text": "are for Safari App Extension"}, {"start": 739.0, "text": "popovers, which you can now"}, {"start": 743.0, "text": "programmatically show and"}, {"start": 745.0, "text": "dismiss."}, {"start": 746.0, "text": "A popover is shown by calling"}, {"start": 748.0, "text": "show popover on an SF Safari"}, {"start": 750.0, "text": "toolbar item, which you can get"}, {"start": 752.0, "text": "from the window that will"}, {"start": 753.0, "text": "present the popover."}, {"start": 755.0, "text": "The popover is dismissed from"}, {"start": 757.0, "text": "your popovers view controller"}, {"start": 759.0, "text": "itself. All you have to do is call"}, {"start": 761.0, "text": "self.dismissPopover."}, {"start": 765.0, "text": "Let's take a look at improving"}, {"start": 767.0, "text": "our extension by adding some of"}, {"start": 769.0, "text": "these new APIs."}, {"start": 773.0, "text": "Using some of these new APIs,"}, {"start": 775.0, "text": "I'd like to upgrade my Safari"}, {"start": 776.0, "text": "Extension."}, {"start": 778.0, "text": "When I click my toolbar item,"}, {"start": 779.0, "text": "I'd like to display a popover"}, {"start": 781.0, "text": "with a table view."}, {"start": 782.0, "text": "There will be one row per tab"}, {"start": 785.0, "text": "and two columns."}, {"start": 786.0, "text": "The left column will be a"}, {"start": 788.0, "text": "screenshot of the tab and the"}, {"start": 790.0, "text": "right column will have the title"}, {"start": 792.0, "text": "of the page and how many"}, {"start": 793.0, "text": "resources were blocked from each"}, {"start": 795.0, "text": "domain."}, {"start": 797.0, "text": "The first step in this process"}, {"start": 799.0, "text": "is telling the popovers view"}, {"start": 801.0, "text": "controller the state of the"}, {"start": 802.0, "text": "Safari window before showing the"}, {"start": 805.0, "text": "popover."}, {"start": 806.0, "text": "To do this, I'll override"}, {"start": 808.0, "text": "popover will show and have it"}, {"start": 810.0, "text": "collect this information."}, {"start": 814.0, "text": "As you can see, the function"}, {"start": 816.0, "text": "iterates over all the tabs in"}, {"start": 818.0, "text": "the window and fills up three"}, {"start": 820.0, "text": "arrays, one for blocked"}, {"start": 822.0, "text": "resources, one for images, and"}, {"start": 827.0, "text": "one for titles."}, {"start": 829.0, "text": "For each tab, we get a"}, {"start": 832.0, "text": "screenshot of the page's visible"}, {"start": 834.0, "text": "area, the title of each page"}, {"start": 840.0, "text": "from the pages' properties, and"}, {"start": 842.0, "text": "the list of blocked resources"}, {"start": 844.0, "text": "for each page."}, {"start": 846.0, "text": "We've also started overriding"}, {"start": 848.0, "text": "popover view controller to"}, {"start": 850.0, "text": "return our view controller."}, {"start": 852.0, "text": "Let's take a look at our view"}, {"start": 854.0, "text": "controller."}, {"start": 856.0, "text": "Set popover state, set some"}, {"start": 859.0, "text": "instance variables in the class,"}, {"start": 861.0, "text": "and then reloads the table view."}, {"start": 865.0, "text": "The last thing we want to do is"}, {"start": 868.0, "text": "when the user clicks on one of"}, {"start": 870.0, "text": "these rows, we want to activate"}, {"start": 873.0, "text": "that tab and then dismiss the"}, {"start": 875.0, "text": "popover."}, {"start": 879.0, "text": "When the table view selection"}, {"start": 880.0, "text": "changes, we activate the tab the"}, {"start": 883.0, "text": "user clicked on, and then"}, {"start": 886.0, "text": "dismiss the popover."}, {"start": 888.0, "text": "Now let's build and run"}, {"start": 889.0, "text": "Animalify again."}, {"start": 898.0, "text": "And we'll launch Safari again"}, {"start": 900.0, "text": "which loads our homepage."}, {"start": 902.0, "text": "And you can see the extensions"}, {"start": 904.0, "text": "aren't turned on anymore."}, {"start": 906.0, "text": "That's because you must allow"}, {"start": 907.0, "text": "unsigned extensions each time"}, {"start": 909.0, "text": "you launch Safari."}, {"start": 911.0, "text": "Let's do that from the develop"}, {"start": 912.0, "text": "menu."}, {"start": 914.0, "text": "And then we'll go to our app and"}, {"start": 917.0, "text": "have it take us to our"}, {"start": 918.0, "text": "extension."}, {"start": 920.0, "text": "We'll turn on the extension and"}, {"start": 922.0, "text": "the Content Blocker and reload"}, {"start": 925.0, "text": "the page. We'll also open a couple more"}, {"start": 928.0, "text": "pages."}, {"start": 931.0, "text": "You'll notice that when we"}, {"start": 932.0, "text": "change tabs away from"}, {"start": 933.0, "text": "bearseating.com, the toolbar"}, {"start": 936.0, "text": "item's badge is cleared."}, {"start": 938.0, "text": "Let's open our popover."}, {"start": 940.0, "text": "And you can see each tab in the"}, {"start": 942.0, "text": "window."}, {"start": 943.0, "text": "In the first row, you can see"}, {"start": 945.0, "text": "that our Content Blocker blocked"}, {"start": 947.0, "text": "two resources from beardiet.com"}, {"start": 949.0, "text": "and one from bearseating.com."}, {"start": 952.0, "text": "Let's activate that tab by"}, {"start": 954.0, "text": "clicking on the first row, and"}, {"start": 956.0, "text": "we're taken back to that tab,"}, {"start": 958.0, "text": "and the popover is dismissed."}, {"start": 960.0, "text": "And those are just some of the"}, {"start": 961.0, "text": "new APIs that we've talked about"}, {"start": 963.0, "text": "today."}, {"start": 968.0, "text": "The last thing I'd like to cover"}, {"start": 971.0, "text": "are some best practices about"}, {"start": 973.0, "text": "how to communicate between your"}, {"start": 975.0, "text": "Safari Extension and your app."}, {"start": 978.0, "text": "Safari launches your app"}, {"start": 980.0, "text": "extension when necessary."}, {"start": 982.0, "text": "There is no guarantee that your"}, {"start": 983.0, "text": "app is running."}, {"start": 985.0, "text": "But if you have an app with an"}, {"start": 987.0, "text": "XPC service, your extension"}, {"start": 990.0, "text": "might want to communicate with"}, {"start": 991.0, "text": "that XPC service."}, {"start": 993.0, "text": "Or you might want to share data"}, {"start": 996.0, "text": "between your Safari Extension"}, {"start": 998.0, "text": "and your app."}, {"start": 999.0, "text": "Your extension could have"}, {"start": 1000.0, "text": "preferences that the user"}, {"start": 1002.0, "text": "configures in your app."}, {"start": 1005.0, "text": "To do this, make your Safari"}, {"start": 1007.0, "text": "Extension and XPC service part"}, {"start": 1010.0, "text": "of the same App Group as your"}, {"start": 1011.0, "text": "app."}, {"start": 1012.0, "text": "This will allow your Safari"}, {"start": 1014.0, "text": "Extension to look up named mock"}, {"start": 1016.0, "text": "services in the same App Group"}, {"start": 1019.0, "text": "and you can use the user"}, {"start": 1020.0, "text": "defaults suiteName initializer"}, {"start": 1023.0, "text": "to share data across the App"}, {"start": 1024.0, "text": "Group."}, {"start": 1026.0, "text": "However, let's say the user"}, {"start": 1028.0, "text": "performs an action in your app"}, {"start": 1030.0, "text": "that is best handled by a Safari"}, {"start": 1032.0, "text": "App Extension."}, {"start": 1033.0, "text": "For example, you're writing a"}, {"start": 1035.0, "text": "password manager and the user"}, {"start": 1037.0, "text": "selects a credential in your app"}, {"start": 1039.0, "text": "to fill."}, {"start": 1040.0, "text": "There's no guarantee that your"}, {"start": 1041.0, "text": "extension is running or that"}, {"start": 1043.0, "text": "Safari is even running."}, {"start": 1045.0, "text": "There's an API you can call from"}, {"start": 1048.0, "text": "your app to send a message to"}, {"start": 1050.0, "text": "your Safari App Extension."}, {"start": 1052.0, "text": "Your app calls SFSafariApplication,"}, {"start": 1054.0, "text": "dispatch message"}, {"start": 1057.0, "text": "with name to extension with"}, {"start": 1059.0, "text": "identifier."}, {"start": 1060.0, "text": "This method will only have an"}, {"start": 1062.0, "text": "effect if your extension is"}, {"start": 1063.0, "text": "enabled and the extension must"}, {"start": 1066.0, "text": "be in the same app bundle as the"}, {"start": 1068.0, "text": "code that calls the API."}, {"start": 1071.0, "text": "Calling this API will send a"}, {"start": 1073.0, "text": "message to Safari, launching it"}, {"start": 1075.0, "text": "if necessary."}, {"start": 1077.0, "text": "And Safari will forward this"}, {"start": 1079.0, "text": "message to your Safari App"}, {"start": 1081.0, "text": "Extension."}, {"start": 1083.0, "text": "Your Safari App Extension can"}, {"start": 1085.0, "text": "listen for these messages by"}, {"start": 1088.0, "text": "implementing message received"}, {"start": 1090.0, "text": "from containing app with name"}, {"start": 1093.0, "text": "user info in your extension's"}, {"start": 1095.0, "text": "principal object."}, {"start": 1097.0, "text": "Let's take a step back and look"}, {"start": 1099.0, "text": "at all the possible ways your"}, {"start": 1101.0, "text": "app and your Safari Extensions"}, {"start": 1103.0, "text": "can communicate and share data."}, {"start": 1107.0, "text": "If your app and Safari Extension"}, {"start": 1109.0, "text": "are in the same App Group, you"}, {"start": 1111.0, "text": "can use NSXPCConnection to"}, {"start": 1113.0, "text": "communicate between them or"}, {"start": 1115.0, "text": "share data using user defaults."}, {"start": 1118.0, "text": "If you want to send a message"}, {"start": 1120.0, "text": "from your app to your Safari App"}, {"start": 1123.0, "text": "Extension, you can use SFSafariApplication"}, {"start": 1125.0, "text": "dispatch message to"}, {"start": 1127.0, "text": "send the message, and listen for"}, {"start": 1130.0, "text": "message received from containing"}, {"start": 1132.0, "text": "app in your Safari App Extension"}, {"start": 1134.0, "text": "to handle the message."}, {"start": 1136.0, "text": "And that's how you communicate"}, {"start": 1139.0, "text": "between your app and your Safari"}, {"start": 1141.0, "text": "Extension."}, {"start": 1144.0, "text": "That concludes what we're"}, {"start": 1145.0, "text": "covering for today."}, {"start": 1147.0, "text": "A few of the major things I'd"}, {"start": 1148.0, "text": "like you to take away from this"}, {"start": 1150.0, "text": "video are, you can distribute"}, {"start": 1152.0, "text": "your Safari Extensions through"}, {"start": 1154.0, "text": "the Mac App Store or as a"}, {"start": 1156.0, "text": "notarized app through your"}, {"start": 1157.0, "text": "website."}, {"start": 1159.0, "text": "You can associate your Content"}, {"start": 1160.0, "text": "Blocker with your Safari App"}, {"start": 1162.0, "text": "Extension so you can find out"}, {"start": 1164.0, "text": "when your Content Blocker"}, {"start": 1165.0, "text": "performs a blocking action."}, {"start": 1168.0, "text": "You can use App Groups to"}, {"start": 1169.0, "text": "communicate between your Safari"}, {"start": 1171.0, "text": "Extension and your app."}, {"start": 1175.0, "text": "All of these APIs we talked"}, {"start": 1176.0, "text": "about today were implemented"}, {"start": 1178.0, "text": "because of your feedback and"}, {"start": 1180.0, "text": "requests."}, {"start": 1181.0, "text": "Please continue to keep filing"}, {"start": 1183.0, "text": "enhancement requests and"}, {"start": 1185.0, "text": "reaching out on the forums."}, {"start": 1186.0, "text": "Thanks, everyone, for taking the"}, {"start": 1188.0, "text": "time to listen, and we can't"}, {"start": 1189.0, "text": "wait to see the extensions you"}]}
